# Every digested source byte is checkout-invariant (Claude/Plans/
# SuperEmbedder_Plan.md §1.3): a provenance or fingerprint digest that varies
# by checkout is useless for the bisect it serves, and SEMB_ENGINE_INSTALL_
# DIVERGED / SEMB_SOURCE_SET_DRIFT would fire spuriously across a
# translating checkout. Applied to every file in this repository — a superset
# of "every file the library target compiles or includes" (§4.1/§8 C33's own
# scope) rather than a curated list that could drift out of sync with what
# the target actually compiles as sources are added.
* -text
